<h2>The game</h2>
<p>Lemmings (Psygnosis, 1991), developed by DMA Design, is a puzzle game. Lemmings walk on, whatever is in their way; you give some of them one of eight skills (climber, floater, bomber, blocker, builder, basher, miner or digger) so that enough of them reach the exit of each level.</p>
<h2>Playing it here</h2>
<p>The game needs Disk 1 and Disk 2 of the original release.</p>
